#9901
ghost alarian~
Alarian~
The ghost of Alarian hovers here above the bier.
~
Reputed to be a noble and courageous ranger, Alarian was renowned as
a guardian of the forest.  Even now, in his ghostly form, you can 
see the regal bearing of his strong, unshaven chin, and the numerous
scars on his incorporeal flesh that tell of many battles won in
defense of the woods he loved so dearly.
~
