lich ancient figure~
the lich~
An ancient figure stands robed here.
~
Obviously once a mage, this skeletal being appears to have passed beyond death
into some realm far removed from the material world. His hollow eye sockets
beam with an intense red light, and his skeletal hands wring silently as he
glares at you. Hatred seems to strike you in a direct beam from his eyes, and
you, quite literally, feel a burning sensation under his intense gaze.
~
