#9905
drake shadow shadowdrake~
the shadowdrake~
An ethereal shadow stares at you with evil yellow eyes.
~
This beast can only be a shadow drake - the undead ghost of a dragonkin that
still exhibits true life, while in the captured form of a ghost. You can feel 
the evil emanating from its misty, amorphous form, begging for release, but
unable to fight against the power that controls its will. Its wings, unlike
those of a true dragon, are small and seem capable of only short flights,
while its sinuous body seems distorted somehow; as though the capture of its
soul has transformed it into a grotesque mockery of its former self.
~
