guard cemetary~
the cemetary guard~
The cemetary guard stands vigil over the gate.
~
Bulky and hearty, this somber-faced guard stands ready to keep the
occupants of the cemetary confined.  His arms are huge and bulge
from beneath his grey uniform and his legs seem to have been crafted,
rather than grown naturally.  It is obvious that nothing is getting
past this guard if he has anything to do about it.
~
